
# GIT VS GITHUB SUMMARY

## Quick Summary

- Git:
    - Version control system
    - Runs locally
    - Tracks changes
    - Creates commits
    - Manages branches
    - Allows me to undo changes

- GitHub:
    - Online platform
    - Hosts Git repositories
    - Allows collaboration
    - Provides Pull Requests
    - Provides Issues
    - Provides Actions
    - Makes projects accessible to other people

